## Inventory, selection, and rejection gate

- **One musk:** Romandolide remains exact for outward fresh-woody diffusion. EB would thicken the cream/skin plane and is reserved for LNDL. Habanolide and Ambrettolide are not stacked merely to imply luxury. Tonalide, Macrolide, and Musk Ketone remain excluded.
- **Radiance rebase:** Hedione HC is 350 uL rather than 420; Iso E Super is 190 rather than 250. They remain space/architecture, not recognizable subjects.
- **Sport-blue rebase:** Dihydromyrcenol is 10 uL of 10% working stock, not 10 uL neat. This preserves a pressure flash while cutting the V2 nominal active dose twenty-fold.
- **Violet realism:** Parmavert is physically depleted and absent. Leafovert supplies sharp cut leaf; Dynascone 10% supplies a bitter galbanic-ozonic incision; Beta Ionone, other ionones, Scentenal, and diluted Clary Sage connect bruised leaf, aromatic stem, and vetiver. Geraniol and Irotyl remain removed because their V2 behavior risked a rose/iris reading or inaudible labeled depth.
- **Sandalwood relief:** Ebanol is moved to 10% and Javanol remains 10%, each at the 10 uL aliquot floor; these are microedges around Sandalore/Polysantol, not co-leads.
- **Apple/pastry exclusion:** Verdox is rejected because its apple-pear woody fruit broadens away from violet leaf. Verdyl Acetate lacks live inventory authority. NYSUPPLY Cinnamon Bark Oil is physically present but excluded because cinnamon shifts this target toward LNDL or gourmand territory.
- **No depleted materials** occur in the current build. Lemon FCF and Cedarwood Virginia occur only in the ideal.

## Required working-stock preparation

Prepare only for a future separately authorized batch. For every new 10% working stock, combine at least **100 uL raw material + 900 uL DPG**, homogenize, and label material, basis, concentration, date, and preparer. This ensures the raw source measurement itself is at least 10 uL. Preserve an existing verified stock when one is already owned.

| Formula stock | Route | Formula aliquot | Neat equivalent | Why |
|---|---|---:|---:|---|
| Lemonile 1% in DPG | existing stock | 50 uL | 0.5 uL | Never use neat Lemonile for this dose |
| Aldehyde C10 1% | existing stock | 30 uL | 0.3 uL | Direct neat dose would be unmeasurable |
| Aldehyde C11 1% | existing stock | 30 uL | 0.3 uL | Direct neat dose would be unmeasurable |
